&lt;p&gt;Unitil Corporation (Unitil or the Company) is a public utility holding company. Unitil Energy Systems, Inc. (UES) is a subsidiary of Unitil and is subject to regulation as a holding company system by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission(FERC)under the Energy Policy Act of 2005.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock>
