      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Other charges include Black Start Charges (ISO New England Inc.'s OATT Schedule 1000) of -$515,238, Energy Administration Service charges of -$128,326, Reliability Administration Service charges of -$76517, and Day-Ahead Ancillary Charges of -$705,286&#160; Black Start and Reliability Must-Run Charges are allocated on the basis of Fitchburg's Network Load.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
